# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private artifact storage (14_SECURITY_PRIVACY_ACCESSIBILITY.md, 12 §1)
# Stands in for private S3-compatible object storage in local development.
# Source artifacts and generated documents must NEVER be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Any location — the vitest api project runs from the repo root, so artifacts
# land at ./.private-storage/ as well as apps/api/.private-storage/.
.private-storage/
apps/api/prisma/*.db
apps/api/prisma/*.db-journal
apps/api/prisma/migrations/dev.db*

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
